\ AOT regression test for lib/net.1z. Exercises ip-string parsing
\ through `parse-ipv4` and `parse-ipv6`. Asserts only that the
\ parser completes; field access on the resulting ip and the
\ split-host-port path are skipped because they hit AOT runtime
\ bugs tracked separately.

use "net" ;

"127.0.0.1" parse-ipv4 drop "v4 ok" print-line
"::1" parse-ipv6 drop "v6 ok" print-line
"127.0.0.1" >ip drop "v4 via >ip" print-line
"::1" >ip drop "v6 via >ip" print-line
